        },
        "quote": "Section 309, Pest elimination, is deleted in its entirety and the following provisions shall be substituted therefor:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.60.180 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "8ec9daa9-289a-5a0f-b5c6-dc1bba6f5530",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 434,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:1",
          "start": 118
        },
        "quote": "309.1, Infestation. Structures shall be kept free from insect and rodent infestations. Structures in which insects or rodents are found shall be promptly exterminated by approved processes that will not be injurious to human health. After pest elimination, proper precautions shall be taken to prevent reinfestation.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.60.180 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "3d11d0ac-4f6c-561d-be7a-7d529224d0ff",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 581,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:2",
          "start": 435
        },
        "quote": "309.2, Owner. The owner of any structure shall be responsible for pest elimination within the structure prior to renting or leasing the structure.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.60.180 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "3e4c4cfd-7bbe-53f7-a56f-2422a6968d90",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 749,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:3",
          "start": 582
        },
        "quote": "309.3, Single occupant. The occupant of a one-family dwelling or of a single-tenant nonresidential structure shall be responsible for pest elimination on the premises.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.60.180 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "fd4f9c0f-98be-58e1-95d6-ba7309d2e305",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1187,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:4",
          "start": 750
        },
        "quote": "309.4, Multiple occupancy. The owner of a structure containing two or more dwelling units, a multiple occupancy, a rooming house or a nonresidential structure shall be responsible for pest elimination in the public or shared areas of the structure and exterior property. If infestation is caused by failure of an occupant to prevent such infestation in the area occupied, the occupant and owner shall be responsible for pest elimination.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.60.180 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "40f06366-fb9a-5e09-ae35-7f35d8464f81",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1322,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:5",
          "start": 1188
        },
        "quote": "309.5, Occupant. The occupant of any structure shall be responsible for the continued rodent and pest-free condition of the structure.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.60.180 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "e0561c58-5ae5-5382-bd2b-f39bd92620df",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1541,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:6",
          "start": 1323
        },
        "quote": "Exception: Where the infestations are caused by defects in the structure or where one or more units are infested from the infestation spreading from a single source, the owner shall be responsible for pest elimination.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.60.180:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
